   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LWF-NS &#xE5;tervandring 03</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF-Novi Sad give information and logistical support for potential returnees in FRY to Croatia and Bosnia. They plan to assist 200 refugee families to return to Croatia, and 125 families to Bosnia and Herzegovina. The LWF program is directly linked with reconstruction programs implemented by LWF in Croatia, and LWF plus CRI in Bosnia and Herzegovina.</narrative>
  </description>
